      "id": "0ZQhv",
      "text": "$-9 \\sqrt{2}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T546J",
      "text": "$-12 \\sqrt{2}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left.\\begin{array}{l}4 x-3 y=12 \\alpha \\\\ 4 x+3 y=\\frac{12}{\\alpha}\\end{array}\\right\\} \\rightarrow 16 x^2-9 y^2=144$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{x^2}{9}-\\frac{y^2}{16}=1 \\rightarrow \\text { Curve :S } \\\\ & T: y=m x \\pm \\sqrt{9 m^2-16} \\\\ & m=\\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{3} \\\\ & y=\\frac{4 \\sqrt{2} x}{3} \\pm \\sqrt{32-16} \\\\ & 3 y=4 \\sqrt{2} x \\pm 12 \\\\ & \\text { as } q>0 \\\\ & 3 y=4 \\sqrt{2} x+12 \\\\ & p=-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}} \\& q=4 \\\\ & p q=-6 \\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
